(text
"J601 DATA supplies only ADuM upstream side through F901. It cannot charge or power the acquisition domain.\nJ901 CHARGE supplies existing F701 / CC current detector / isolated DC-DC chain. D+/D- are NC.\nNo DATA_RAW/DATA_5V to HOST_RAW/HOST_5V connection or diode OR. Both ports share only HOST_GND and shields.\nDATA-only requires battery; CHARGE 1.5A/3A + POWER ON can supply acquisition with charging disabled. POWER OFF charges.\nDo not replace the isolation chain by a non-isolated ESP dev-board power circuit."
